{
  "name": "TRB — Lead Capture + Welcome Email",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "hook": 1,
        "maxResults": 1
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "restore": {
          "parameters": {
            "hook": {
              "label": "TRB Lead Capture Webhook",
              "connection": null
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": { "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 } },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 3,
              "module": "gmail:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": { "account": 1 },
              "mapper": {
                "to": "{{1.email}}",
                "subject": "Your Footwork Foundation Protocol",
                "contentType": "html",
                "content": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thee Rainers</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px;\">Your 30-day Footwork Foundation protocol is ready.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">30 days. One mechanic at a time. Start session one today.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<a href=\"https://theerainers.com/pdfs/footwork-foundation.pdf\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0057FF;color:#fff;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;\">Download Protocol</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;\">The protocol covers ground contact, balance mechanics, pivot systems, and how footwork connects to your punch output. Do the work and the mechanics compound.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Rainers</p>\n</div>",
                "sendAs": null,
                "cc": null,
                "bcc": null,
                "replyTo": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                "attachments": null
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 600, "y": -400 },
                "restore": {
                  "parameters": {
                    "account": {
                      "label": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                      "connection": "google"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": {
            "name": "Footwork Foundation",
            "conditions": [
              [
                {
                  "a": "{{1.source}}",
                  "b": "footwork-foundation",
                  "o": "text:equal"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 4,
              "module": "gmail:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": { "account": 1 },
              "mapper": {
                "to": "{{1.email}}",
                "subject": "Your 7-Lever Audit",
                "contentType": "html",
                "content": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thee Rainers</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px;\">Your 7-Lever Self-Assessment is ready.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">Seven levers. One broken lever kills performance across all the others. Find yours.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<a href=\"https://theerainers.com/pdfs/lever-audit.pdf\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0057FF;color:#fff;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;\">Download Audit</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;\">Work through each lever honestly. The audit only works if you score what you actually see in sparring, not what you wish was true.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Rainers</p>\n</div>",
                "sendAs": null,
                "cc": null,
                "bcc": null,
                "replyTo": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                "attachments": null
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 600, "y": -200 },
                "restore": {
                  "parameters": {
                    "account": {
                      "label": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                      "connection": "google"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": {
            "name": "Lever Audit",
            "conditions": [
              [
                {
                  "a": "{{1.source}}",
                  "b": "lever-audit",
                  "o": "text:equal"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 5,
              "module": "gmail:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": { "account": 1 },
              "mapper": {
                "to": "{{1.email}}",
                "subject": "Your lever audit results",
                "contentType": "html",
                "content": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thee Rainers</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px;\">You completed the 7-Lever Audit.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">Now you know which lever is limiting everything else. That gap is where the work starts.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;\">The Defense Workshop breaks down the mechanics directly. 90 minutes. Footwork, stance, punch mechanics, defensive structure.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<a href=\"https://theerainers.com/workshop\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0057FF;color:#fff;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;\">See the Defense Workshop</a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Rainers</p>\n</div>",
                "sendAs": null,
                "cc": null,
                "bcc": null,
                "replyTo": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                "attachments": null
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
                "restore": {
                  "parameters": {
                    "account": {
                      "label": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                      "connection": "google"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": {
            "name": "Lever Quiz",
            "conditions": [
              [
                {
                  "a": "{{1.source}}",
                  "b": "lever-audit-quiz",
                  "o": "text:equal"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 6,
              "module": "gmail:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": { "account": 1 },
              "mapper": {
                "to": "{{1.email}}",
                "subject": "Monthly Q&A — you're in",
                "contentType": "html",
                "content": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thee Rainers</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px;\">You are registered for the Monthly Q&amp;A.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">Bring a specific question. Vague questions get vague answers. The more specific you are about your mechanical problem, the more precise the diagnosis.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;\">The link and time will come closer to the session date. Check your inbox.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Rainers</p>\n</div>",
                "sendAs": null,
                "cc": null,
                "bcc": null,
                "replyTo": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                "attachments": null
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 200 },
                "restore": {
                  "parameters": {
                    "account": {
                      "label": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                      "connection": "google"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": {
            "name": "Q&A Registration",
            "conditions": [
              [
                {
                  "a": "{{1.source}}",
                  "b": "qa-registration",
                  "o": "text:equal"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 7,
              "module": "gmail:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": { "account": 1 },
              "mapper": {
                "to": "{{1.email}}",
                "subject": "You are on the list",
                "contentType": "html",
                "content": "<div style=\"font-family:monospace;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px;color:#0A0A0A;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888;margin:0 0 24px;\">Thee Rainers</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 8px;\">Got it.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px;\">You are on the list. More coming soon.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">Rainers</p>\n</div>",
                "sendAs": null,
                "cc": null,
                "bcc": null,
                "replyTo": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                "attachments": null
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 400 },
                "restore": {
                  "parameters": {
                    "account": {
                      "label": "rainers@theerainers.com",
                      "connection": "google"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
